t be thriller.\n\nLet’s summarize:\n\n**Position 1**:  \n- Job: videographer  \n- Nationality: nigerian  \n- Movie-Genre: thriller  \n\n**Position 2**:  \n- Job: freelancer  \n- Nationality: pakistani  \n- Movie-Genre: animation  \n\nNow answer the questions:\n\n1. **What is the job of the person who is pakistani?**  \n   → Pakistani is in position 2 → job is **freelancer**\n\n2. **What is the movie genre of the person who is pakistani?**  \n   → Position 2 → movie genre is **animation**\n\n3. **What movie genre does the person in position 1 watch?**  \n   → Position 1 → **thriller**\n\n4. **At what position is the person who is a videographer?**  \n   → Position **1**\n\nSo answers in order:  \n1. freelancer  \n2. animation  \n3. thriller  \n4. 1\n\nFinal answer format:  \n<solution>freelancer, animation, thriller, 1</solution>\n\nFinal answer: <solution>freelancer, animation, thriller, 1</solution>", "logprobs": [{"token": "We", "logprob": -0.1269288957118988}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.029860686510801315}, {"token": " told", "logprob": -0.9740786552429199}, {"token": " there", "logprob": -0.477460116147995}, {"token": " are", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " two", "logprob": -0.5891649723052979}, {"token": " people", "logprob": -2.264974000354414e-06}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.0026175067760050297}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.005279290024191141}, {"token": " line", "logprob": -8.344646857949556e-07}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0015128131490200758}, {"token": " numbered", "logprob": -0.050706300884485245}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.03642578795552254}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": -0.01816880889236927}, {"token": "left", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -0.003177833277732134}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.12692804634571075}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "2", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "right", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ").", "logprob": -0.126